Sign-in-gated material
----------------------
A small number of Fluent 2 pages — notably the AI/Copilot component usage pages and four
"Working with AI" topics — are published by Microsoft behind an employee sign-in. Their
guidance text is NOT redistributed in this repository. For those items the published
datasets carry only factual scaffolding (component and part names, section headings, the
official documentation URL, and links to publicly hosted images), plus a `gatedNotice`
field pointing readers to the official page. Readers who have access can restore the full
text on their own machine; see scripts/split-gated-content.mjs. The same rule keeps
`research/` and `assets/screenshots/` out of this repository.

Image URLs reference Microsoft's public CDN rather than vendoring copies of the assets.

