`mcp/data/fluent-icons.json` is generated by `scripts/build-icons.mjs` from that
repository's two machine-readable manifests — `assets/<Icon Name>/metadata.json` and
`packages/react-icons/metadata.json`. It embeds icon NAMES, SIZES, STYLES, DESCRIPTIONS
and METAPHOR KEYWORDS only, so that an agent can return an export name that actually
compiles. No SVG artwork, no icon fonts and no other icon binaries are copied into this
repository.

Product/launch icons and file-type icons are deliberately excluded. The Fluent 2 site
separates those from the MIT-licensed system icon set, and Microsoft brand and trademark
terms apply to them; the same policy excludes brand-named device icons from the generated
dataset. Nothing in that dataset grants any right to Microsoft's trademarks or brand
assets.

